%% A flowchart: the most written of Mermaid's diagrams.
flowchart TD
  Start([Someone opens a file]) --> Kind{What kind is it?}
  Kind -->|Markdown| Preview[Show the preview]
  Kind -->|Mermaid| Diagram[Draw the diagram]
  Kind -->|Anything else| Raw[Show the source]
  subgraph drawing[Drawing it]
    Preview --> Layout[Lay the text out]
    Diagram --> Scene[Work out the scene]
    Layout --> Paint[Paint it]
    Scene --> Paint
  end
  Raw --> Paint
  Paint --> Done(((On the screen)))
